Z||000006||Shaun41178||12-24-1999||11:11 PM||||Man having Mustangs Challenge you?  I have only had one car challenge me and that was a Ford thunderbird supercoupe with the supercharger.  Of course I put the smackdown on him.<P>All my other street races I have had to instigate.  I guess it might be because my car doen't look like much in the speed department.  I would love to have more challengers as I am tired of being the one to challenge all the time.  Why can't things like this happen to me?  I consider you one lucky person although you have stated you opinion quite clearly.  <P>Merry Christmas everyone!  ||||reg||1
